  "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-3 \\\\  & -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{4}+8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-13{x}^{2}+x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x-3}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-5x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}-5x+6.$",
